        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to complying with global quality and safety requirements and guidance by developing and manufacturing our products in accordance with Current Good Clinical Practices (cGCP), Current Good Laboratory Practices (cGLP), and Current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP), thereby seeking to leverage safety, effectiveness and quality as a competitive advantage.",
